            <h3 data-number="5.4.12" id="relatedencoding"><span
            class="header-section-number">5.4.12</span> <span
            class="citation"
            data-cites="relatedEncoding">@relatedEncoding</span></h3>
            <p><strong>Attribute name:</strong> <a
            href="http://lido-schema.org/schema/latest/lido.html#relatedEncoding">lido:relatedEncoding</a></p>
            <p><strong>Note:</strong> Attribute held by the &lt;<a
            href="https://lido-schema.org/schema/latest/lido.html#lidoWrap">lido:lidoWrap</a>&gt;
            and &lt;<a
            href="https://lido-schema.org/schema/latest/lido.html#lido">lido:lido</a>&gt;
            elements to indicate the format of the whole data source
            from which the data were migrated. For individual elements
            with data values the corresponding source data fields can be
            indicated using the attributes <a
            href="https://lido-schema.org/schema/latest/lido.html#encodinganalog">lido:encodinganalog</a>
            and <a
            href="https://lido-schema.org/schema/latest/lido.html#label">lido:label</a>.</p>
            <h3 data-number="5.4.13" id="sortorder"><span
            class="header-section-number">5.4.13</span> <span
            class="citation"
            data-cites="sortorder">@sortorder</span></h3>
            <p><strong>Attribute name:</strong> <a
            href="http://lido-schema.org/schema/latest/lido.html#sortorder">lido:sortorder</a></p>
            <p><strong>Note:</strong> Attribute held by many LIDO
            elements to suggest a sequential ordering among sibling
            elements for online presentation.</p>
            <p><strong>Example:</strong> The following XML code snippet
            marks the “<a
            href="http://terminology.lido-schema.org/lido00001">Aquisition</a>”
            of the object as the second event in the list of events the
            object is involved in.</p>
            <div class="sourceCode" id="cb56"><pre
            class="sourceCode xml"><code class="sourceCode xml"><span id="cb56-1"><a href="#cb56-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>&lt;<span class="kw">lido:eventSet</span></span>
<span id="cb56-2"><a href="#cb56-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="ot">    lido:sortorder=</span><span class="st">&quot;2&quot;</span>&gt;</span>
<span id="cb56-3"><a href="#cb56-3" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>    &lt;<span class="kw">lido:event</span>&gt;</span>
<span id="cb56-4"><a href="#cb56-4" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>        &lt;<span class="kw">lido:eventType</span>&gt;</span>
<span id="cb56-5"><a href="#cb56-5" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>            &lt;<span class="kw">skos:Concept</span></span>
<span id="cb56-6"><a href="#cb56-6" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="ot">                rdf:about=</span><span class="st">&quot;http://terminology.lido-schema.org/lido00001&quot;</span>&gt;</span>
<span id="cb56-7"><a href="#cb56-7" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>                &lt;<span class="kw">skos:prefLabel</span></span>
<span id="cb56-8"><a href="#cb56-8" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="ot">                    xml:lang=</span><span class="st">&quot;en&quot;</span>&gt;</span>
<span id="cb56-9"><a href="#cb56-9" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>                    Acquisition</span>
<span id="cb56-10"><a href="#cb56-10" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>                &lt;/<span class="kw">skos:prefLabel</span>&gt;</span>
<span id="cb56-11"><a href="#cb56-11" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>                &lt;<span class="kw">skos:prefLabel</span></span>
<span id="cb56-12"><a href="#cb56-12" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="ot">                    xml:lang=</span><span class="st">&quot;de&quot;</span>&gt;</span>
<span id="cb56-13"><a href="#cb56-13" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>                    Erwerb</span>
<span id="cb56-14"><a href="#cb56-14" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>                &lt;/<span class="kw">skos:prefLabel</span>&gt;</span>
<span id="cb56-15"><a href="#cb56-15" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>            &lt;/<span class="kw">skos:Concept</span>&gt;</span>
<span id="cb56-16"><a href="#cb56-16" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>         &lt;/<span class="kw">lido:eventType</span>&gt;</span>
<span id="cb56-17"><a href="#cb56-17" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>    &lt;<span class="kw">lido:event</span>&gt;</span>
<span id="cb56-18"><a href="#cb56-18" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>&lt;/<span class="kw">lido:eventSet</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div>
            <h3 data-number="5.4.14" id="source"><span
            class="header-section-number">5.4.14</span> <span
            class="citation" data-cites="source">@source</span></h3>
            <p><strong>Attribute name:</strong> <a
            href="http://lido-schema.org/schema/latest/lido.html#source">lido:source</a></p>
            <p><strong>Note:</strong> Attribute held by identifier and
            date elements to describe the source of the information
            given in the holding element.</p>
            <p><strong>Example:</strong> The following XML code snippet
            shows the source for the estimated earlie